WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Come into a low lunge, back knee down.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Tuck the pelvis gently.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Pulse forward and back in a tiny range.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep ribs soft.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
